# Declension: en.wiktionary.org, entry “हफ़्ता” (masculine ā-stem: हफ़्ता / हफ़्ते / हफ़्तों).  A noun counted by a
# numeral stands in the OBLIQUE case, so the oblique forms are unit
# surfaces in their own right.
# सप्ताह is the formal doublet (masculine consonant stem, invariant in the
# singular); en.wiktionary lists each as the other's synonym, and CLDR 47
# uses सप्ताह in the week field.  हफ्ता is the nukta-less spelling.
हफ़्ता
हफ़्ते
हफ़्तों
हफ्ता
हफ्ते
हफ्तों
सप्ताह
सप्ताहों
